00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:46,000
Paw Patrol: The Mighty Movie is a 2023 Canadian animated action-adventure
comedy film  based on the television series Paw Patrol.

11
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:26,000
The sequel to Paw Patrol: The Movie (2021), it was directed by Cal
Brunker, who co-wrote the screenplay with Bob Barlen.

12
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
The film features an ensemble voice cast, including Mckenna Grace, Taraji P.

13
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:46,000
Henson, Marsai Martin, Christian Convery, Lil Rel Howery, Kim Kardashian, Chris Rock, Serena Williams, Alan
Kim, Brice Gonzalez, North West, Saint West, James Marsden, Kristen Bell, and Finn Lee-Epp.

14
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:26,000
In the film, the Paw Patrol pups gain superpowers from crystals inside a meteor and must stop Mayor
Humdinger and his new accomplice Victoria Vance from wreaking havoc in Adventure City.

15
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
In August 2021, following the success of the first film, director
Brunker expressed interest in returning for a sequel.

16
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
The sequel was greenlit by Spin Master Entertainment in November 2021, with a planned October
13, 2023 release date, before being pushed forward to a September 2023 release.

17
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
The film features elements from the Mighty Pups sub-theme of the main show.

18
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Mikros Image in Montreal returned to provide computer-animation,
while the musical score was composed by Pinar Toprak.

19
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
Most of the main voice cast was announced in January 2023,
following Henson's casting in May 2022.

20
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
Paw Patrol: The Mighty Movie was released in Canada by Elevation Pictures and in the United States by Paramount Pictures on September 29, 2023, it
received mixed reviews from critics and was a financial success, grossing $205 million against a production budget of $30 million.

21
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
A third film, Paw Patrol: The Dino Movie, is in development.

22
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
The film explores themes of superhero, cartoon, mad scientist, sequel, dog.

23
01:24:20,000 --> 01:24:26,000
The tone is lighthearted.
